Inclua estes imports no topo do guiValidation:

import java.awt.Toolkit
import java.awt.datatransfer.StringSelection

No grupo guiBehavior do ImageLoader, inclua:

'formulaireTitle' :
	'Images/GUI behavior/formulaireTitle.PNG',

'ActualiserBtn' :
	'Images/GUI behavior/ActualiserBtn.PNG',

Agora inclua este bloco completo no guiValidation:

// ======================================================
// APPLY FORMULAIRE FILTER
// ======================================================

@Keyword
void applyFormulaireFilter(
	String filterValue
) {

	Integer imageTimeout = 5

	String cleanFilterValue =
		safeText(
			filterValue
		)

	if (cleanFilterValue.isEmpty()) {
		KeywordUtil.markFailedAndStop(
			'Formulaire filter value is empty.'
		)

		return
	}

	logStep(
		'APPLY FORMULAIRE FILTER',
		'Filter value: ' + cleanFilterValue + '\n' +
		'Flow:\n' +
		'- Click Formulaire title\n' +
		'- Press TAB twice\n' +
		'- Clear input field\n' +
		'- Enter filter value\n' +
		'- Click Actualiser\n' +
		'- Wait 10 seconds'
	)


	// ======================================================
	// CLICK FORMULAIRE TITLE
	// ======================================================

	boolean formulaireTitleClicked =
		clickFirstVisibleImage(
			GUI_IMAGE_GROUP,
			[
				'formulaireTitle'
			],
			imageTimeout
		)

	if (!formulaireTitleClicked) {
		takeEvidence(
			'GUI_FormulaireTitleNotFound.png'
		)

		KeywordUtil.markFailedAndStop(
			'Formulaire title image was not found.\n' +
			'Image key: formulaireTitle'
		)

		return
	}

	KeywordUtil.logInfo(
		'[FORMULAIRE FILTER] Formulaire title clicked.'
	)

	Windows.delay(1)


	// ======================================================
	// MOVE TO INPUT FIELD
	// ======================================================

	pressKeyboardKey(
		KeyEvent.VK_TAB
	)

	Windows.delay(1)

	pressKeyboardKey(
		KeyEvent.VK_TAB
	)

	Windows.delay(1)

	KeywordUtil.logInfo(
		'[FORMULAIRE FILTER] TAB pressed twice. Input field should be focused.'
	)


	// ======================================================
	// CLEAR INPUT AND ENTER VALUE
	// ======================================================

	Robot robot =
		new Robot()

	robot.setAutoDelay(
		100
	)

	robot.keyPress(
		KeyEvent.VK_CONTROL
	)

	robot.keyPress(
		KeyEvent.VK_A
	)

	robot.keyRelease(
		KeyEvent.VK_A
	)

	robot.keyRelease(
		KeyEvent.VK_CONTROL
	)

	Windows.delay(1)

	robot.keyPress(
		KeyEvent.VK_BACK_SPACE
	)

	robot.keyRelease(
		KeyEvent.VK_BACK_SPACE
	)

	Windows.delay(1)

	StringSelection filterSelection =
		new StringSelection(
			cleanFilterValue
		)

	Toolkit
		.getDefaultToolkit()
		.getSystemClipboard()
		.setContents(
			filterSelection,
			null
		)

	robot.keyPress(
		KeyEvent.VK_CONTROL
	)

	robot.keyPress(
		KeyEvent.VK_V
	)

	robot.keyRelease(
		KeyEvent.VK_V
	)

	robot.keyRelease(
		KeyEvent.VK_CONTROL
	)

	Windows.delay(1)

	KeywordUtil.logInfo(
		'[FORMULAIRE FILTER] Input field cleared and value entered.\n' +
		'Value: ' + cleanFilterValue
	)


	// ======================================================
	// CLICK ACTUALISER
	// ======================================================

	boolean actualiserClicked =
		clickFirstVisibleImage(
			GUI_IMAGE_GROUP,
			[
				'ActualiserBtn'
			],
			imageTimeout
		)

	if (!actualiserClicked) {
		takeEvidence(
			'GUI_ActualiserButtonNotFound.png'
		)

		KeywordUtil.markFailedAndStop(
			'Actualiser button image was not found.\n' +
			'Image key: ActualiserBtn\n' +
			'Filter value: ' + cleanFilterValue
		)

		return
	}

	KeywordUtil.logInfo(
		'[FORMULAIRE FILTER] Actualiser button clicked.\n' +
		'Waiting 10 seconds for refresh.'
	)

	Windows.delay(10)

	takeEvidence(
		'GUI_FormulaireFilterApplied.png'
	)

	KeywordUtil.markPassed(
		'Formulaire filter applied successfully.\n' +
		'Filter value: ' + cleanFilterValue + '\n' +
		'Actualiser was clicked and the system waited 10 seconds.'
	)
}

No TC, deixe o valor visível nas configurações:

String formulaireFilterValue = '10E'

E faça a chamada:

CustomKeywords.'pageObject.guiValidation.applyFormulaireFilter'(
	formulaireFilterValue
)
